{"4327930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slow Summit", "steam_appid": 4327930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take a Breath and Enjoy the Climb</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a cozy outdoor activity game where you take a slow mountain trip with your friends. Traverse a beautiful, low-poly world by hiking hills, paddling upstream, and climbing steep cliffs on your way to the very top. Whether hiking solo or teaming up with friends, the mountain is yours to explore at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/1d32ced5d66b24d70b9a680ae933ea4d.poster.avif?t=1785515693\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/1d32ced5d66b24d70b9a680ae933ea4d.webm?t=1785515693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/1d32ced5d66b24d70b9a680ae933ea4d.mp4?t=1785515693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/e9a3a36279989f84a7312cc656ea587b.poster.avif?t=1785515693\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/e9a3a36279989f84a7312cc656ea587b.webm?t=1785515693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/e9a3a36279989f84a7312cc656ea587b.mp4?t=1785515693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/fc6f7e9d7f6629a2fee85d62b138a7f7.poster.avif?t=1785515693\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/fc6f7e9d7f6629a2fee85d62b138a7f7.webm?t=1785515693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/fc6f7e9d7f6629a2fee85d62b138a7f7.mp4?t=1785515693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rest and Recover at the Stations</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real-world mountain expeditions, your journey is paced by numbered Rest Stations. Stamina burning out? Reach the next camp to catch your breath and restore your energy! These campsites are your checkpoints to relax, trade your collected items with local NPCs, and stick-cook over a crackling fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/c67992f75b1f548efcb4c9a22058e71d.poster.avif?t=1785515693\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/c67992f75b1f548efcb4c9a22058e71d.webm?t=1785515693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/c67992f75b1f548efcb4c9a22058e71d.mp4?t=1785515693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Outdoor Activities</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mountain is filled with charming distractions. When you aren't focused on reaching the next checkpoint, you can slow down and enjoy a variety of side activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/143fe5038cd0bad7095fa62e8a61de76.poster.avif?t=1785515693\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/143fe5038cd0bad7095fa62e8a61de76.webm?t=1785515693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/143fe5038cd0bad7095fa62e8a61de76.mp4?t=1785515693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/1d9385b8c2a993d81634bcdc2603c6d9.poster.avif?t=1785515693\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/1d9385b8c2a993d81634bcdc2603c6d9.webm?t=1785515693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/1d9385b8c2a993d81634bcdc2603c6d9.mp4?t=1785515693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey to the Summit:</strong> Hike, paddle, and climb your way through beautifully themed environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stamina System:</strong> Manage your energy carefully—pushing forward while exhausted might cause a clumsy slip!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rest at the Stations:</strong> Stop at numbered camps to recover stamina, cook food over a campfire, and trade with NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork on the Trail:</strong> Play solo or in online co-op with up to 5 players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Side Activities:</strong> Take a break from the trail to cast a fishing line, fly a kite, and more!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take a Breath and Enjoy the Climb</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a cozy outdoor activity game where you take a slow mountain trip with your friends. Traverse a beautiful, low-poly world by hiking hills, paddling upstream, and climbing steep cliffs on your way to the very top. Whether hiking solo or teaming up with friends, the mountain is yours to explore at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/1d32ced5d66b24d70b9a680ae933ea4d.poster.avif?t=1785515693\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/1d32ced5d66b24d70b9a680ae933ea4d.webm?t=1785515693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/1d32ced5d66b24d70b9a680ae933ea4d.mp4?t=1785515693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/e9a3a36279989f84a7312cc656ea587b.poster.avif?t=1785515693\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/e9a3a36279989f84a7312cc656ea587b.webm?t=1785515693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/e9a3a36279989f84a7312cc656ea587b.mp4?t=1785515693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327930/extras/fc6